Bachelor or Master degree;
International Software Testing Qualifications Board (ISTQB) Foundation certification or similar certification is required. Any relevant additional QA certifications are desirable;
+3 years of providing software quality assurance for medium-large sized development teams is required;
+3 years of experience in developing Test Automation Frameworks or designing automated testing suites is required;
